        "original_id": "dac10fe5-ec4c-5f5c-a7b8-a9d68cbc6781",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: After Aida, Verdi's Messiah, Otello\n- People: Julian Mitchell, Giuseppe Verdi\n- Places: Teatro alla Scala, Milan\n\nFacts:\n- After Aida, originally titled \"Verdi's Messiah,\" is a 1985 play-with-music by Julian Mitchell.\n- In After Aida, continued prodding from Giuseppe Verdi's friends leads to the creation of Otello.\n- Otello premiered in 1887.\n- Otello was first performed at the Teatro alla Scala in Milan on 5 February 1887.\n- Otello was Giuseppe Verdi's penultimate opera.",
